#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""SafeVoice update 3: new HDS CDM (domains inside hds-cdm.ttl), core/application split by CDM terms,
extension ontology, audit-log chain, keyed record hashes, and the admin, resend, mock-data and FDP tools.

Run from the repository root (after update 1 and update 2 were applied):
    python apply_safevoice_changes_3.py --check     preview
    python apply_safevoice_changes_3.py             apply

Keeps each file's own line endings and other people's edits; edits by exact text. If a file does not
match what it expects, NOTHING is written and the file is named. Safe to run twice.
The two HDS files in config/hds are replaced as a whole (they belong to the HDS project, not to us).
"""
