   "# APPLICATION MAPPING: SafeVoice (human trafficking) specific terms.\n# Anything the shared HDS CDM has no term for lives here: terms of other vocabularies (schema.org,\n# PROV, DCMI) and our own extension terms (cdm:..., declared in config/safevoice-extension.ttl).\n# To reuse the pipeline for another application, replace this file; mapping_core.yml stays the same.\n# The domain tag decides which extra incident properties apply (hds:applicableProperty in\n# config/hds/hds-cdm.ttl).\n\nx-columns:\n  departure: &departure_cols"
